      "text": "Hebt den Verteidigungs-Wert eines Pokémon im Kampf\nstark an. Die Wirkung wird mit dem Austausch des\nPokémon beendet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta mucho la Defensa en combate. Al cambiar de\nPokémon, el efecto desaparece.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta di molto la Difesa di un Pokémon in una\nlotta. L’effetto svanisce se il Pokémon è sostituito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item that sharply boosts the Defense stat of a\nPokémon during a battle. It wears off once the\nPokémon is withdrawn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "戦闘中の　ポケモンの\n防御を　大きく　あげる　道具。\nひっこめると　元に　戻る。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大幅提高战斗中\n宝可梦防御的道具。\n离场后，效果便会消失。",
